    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan Universitys' Institute for Educational Development, East Africa (AKU-IED, EA) has launched a two-year diploma programme in Education Leadership and Management. The diploma, under the Foundations for Learning (F4L) project, is targeted at school leaders, head teachers and their deputies. AKU-IED, EA is partnering with the Kenya Education Management Institute (KEMI) to deliver the curriculum.",
